{"name":"Dokukawaii","title":"Dokukawaii","revision":236357,"url":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/Dokukawaii","retrieved":"2026-09-06","license":"CC BY-SA","licenseUrl":"https://www.fandom.com/licensing","language":"en","blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","text":"It is often conflated with the Yami Kawaii and Gurokawa aesthetic by those not familiar with it."},{"kind":"heading","text":"History"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"The term Dokukawaii was originally coined by artist Miruki to describe her morbid neon art style. Even before it was officially given a name, this aesthetic would already be spotted in the various works of Japanese artists."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Visuals"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"The visuals of Dokukawaii juxtapositions bright neon colors with sickly imagery. The aesthetic uses motifs related to toxicity/medical trauma like gas masks, fruits, slime, poison, etc."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Media"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Comics"},{"kind":"list","text":"Everything Sucks"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Manga & Anime"},{"kind":"list","text":"Coppelion"},{"kind":"list","text":"Dandadan"},{"kind":"list","text":"HYPERSONIC Music Club"},{"kind":"list","text":"Jashin-chan Dropkick"},{"kind":"list","text":"Zom 100: Bucket List of the Dead"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Music"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Artists"},{"kind":"list","text":"Dj Technorch"},{"kind":"list","text":"Kairiki Bear (recent works, like Anatasama and Bug)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Nekozuna"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Resources"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Art"},{"kind":"list","text":"Miruki"},{"kind":"list","text":"Mitsume"},{"kind":"list","text":"Project C.K"},{"kind":"list","text":"Yukaman"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Vendors"},{"kind":"list","text":"ACDC RAG"},{"kind":"list","text":"Brokendoll Japan"},{"kind":"list","text":"Invasion Club"},{"kind":"list","text":"Ningen Allergy"},{"kind":"list","text":"Nonokisoyo"}],"contentStatus":"full-source","images":[{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/f/fa/Dokukawaii.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230122020935","caption":"Dokukawaii · Visual reference 01","source":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/File:Dokukawaii.jpg","remote":true,"local":"images/detail/0306-1.webp","localAvailable":true},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/4/4c/Miruki_exhibition.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20230122145654","caption":"Dokukawaii · Visual reference 02","source":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/File:Miruki_exhibition.jpg","remote":true,"local":"images/detail/0306-2.webp","localAvailable":true}]}